Package: domak
Version: @VERSION@
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Grady Zhuo <gradyzhuo@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/gradyzhuo/swift-domak-cli
Description: Scaffold swift-ddd-kit DDD/Event-Sourcing starter projects
 domak generates a runnable Domain-Driven Design + Event Sourcing starter
 project wired to swift-ddd-kit and KurrentDB: an aggregate root, Create/
 Rename/Delete use cases, a read-side projector, and aggregate-level unit
 tests. See https://github.com/gradyzhuo/swift-domak-cli for details.
